ne-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">IT개발/서비스기획</span>&nbsp;[ 네이버 웍스모바일, 우아한형제들, SSG, CNCITY Energy ]</span></li><li style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span class=\"stb-bold\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">생산/품질/R&amp;D&nbsp;</span>[ 삼성전자, 현대제철, SK하이닉스, LG디스플레이, 에이프로젠 ]</span></li><li style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span class=\"stb-bold\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">유통/물류/해외영업</span>&nbsp;[ 현대자동차, HYBE, 대상 주식회사, 크몽 ]</span></li><li style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span class=\"stb-bold\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">인사/총무/회계</span>&nbsp;[ 카카오엔터프라이즈, 현대엘리베이터, (주)신세계백화점 ]</span></li><li style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span class=\"stb-bold\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">공사/공기업</span>&nbsp;[ 한국철도공사, 한국직업능력연구원, 한국계량측정협회 ]</span></li><li style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span class=\"stb-bold\" style=\"border: 0px; outline-style: initial; outline-width: 0px; font-style: inherit; font-variant: inherit; font-weight: bold; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: inherit; line-height: inherit; font-family: inherit; vertical-align: baseline;\">전문직/기타</span>&nbsp;[ 더원인사노무컨설팅(노무사), 대한적십자사(NGO), 능실종합사회복지관 ]</span></li></ul><div style=\"\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;</span>운영 일시<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">- 2022</span>년<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 5</span>월<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 9</span>일<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (</span>월<span lang=\"EN-US\">) ~ 5</span>월<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 20</span>일<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (</span>금<span lang=\"EN-US\">) (</span>총<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 10</span>일간 진행<span lang=\"EN-US\">)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><a name=\"_heading=h.gjdgxs\"></a><span lang=\"EN-US\">- </span>매일<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 19:00~21:00 (2</span>시간<span lang=\"EN-US\">)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;*대상: 재학생(4학년) 및 휴학생</span>&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;</span>클래스<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">- </span>직무 특강<span lang=\"EN-US\"> : 40</span>개 클래스<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (</span>매일<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 4</span>개씩\n진행<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>전 세션 현직자 참여<span lang=\"EN-US\">)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">- </span>강의 구성<span lang=\"EN-US\"> : 75</span>분 특강<span lang=\"EN-US\"> + 45</span>분<span lang=\"EN-US\">\nQ&amp;A (2</span>시간<span lang=\"EN-US\">)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; * </span>기업 현직자 상황에 따라 직무 및 일정이 일부 변경될 수 있습니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;</span>신청 일정<span lang=\"EN-US\"> : 2022</span>년<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 4</span>월<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 26</span>일<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (</span>화<span lang=\"EN-US\">) ~ </span>클래스 시작<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 2</span>시간\n전</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">- </span>특강별<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 100</span>명 정원<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">- </span>타 대학 학생들도\n함께 신청하니 참고 바랍니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;</span>운영 방식<span lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span>온라인<span lang=\"EN-US\"> Live </span>강의<span lang=\"EN-US\"> (</span>잇다\n온라인 클래스 시스템<span lang=\"EN-US\">)</span><br></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">*&nbsp;</span>신청 방법</p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;1) </span>잇다 홈페이지 접속<span lang=\"EN-US\"> : https://www.itdaa.net/conferences/itdaacon-may-22<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;2) (</span>필수<span lang=\"EN-US\">) </span>학교 이메일 계정으로\n잇다 회원가입 후 로그인<span lang=\"EN-US\"> ( @<span style=\"color:red\">0000.ac.kr </span>)<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span>학교 이메일 계정이 아닐 경우 신청 불가능<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * </span>이미 잇다 계정이 있는 경우에도 학교 이메일로 재가입 필요<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;3) </span>참여할 클래스 선택<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;4) </span>멘토 정보<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>클래스 상세페이지를\n살펴본 후 관심 있는 클래스 신청<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-indent:10.0pt;line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;* </span>신청은 선착순으로 마감됩니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;5) </span>신청 정보 작성<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;6) </span>신청 완료 알림톡 수신<span lang=\"EN-US\">, </span>참여\n방법 및 안내 가이드 확인<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">※ </span>유의사항<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">- </span>신청은 선착순으로\n마감됩니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>여석이 없는 클래스에는<span lang=\"EN-US\"> '</span>공석알림<span lang=\"EN-US\">'</span>을 신청할 수 있습니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">. </span>취소자가 발생하여</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\">&nbsp;신청이 가능하면 공석알림을\n보내드립니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:normal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">- </span>신청은 클래스\n시작<span lang=\"EN-US\"> 2</span>시간 전까지 가능합니다<span lang=\"EN-US\">.<o:p></o:p></span></p>\n\n<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;\nmso-bidi-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;mso-fareast-language:KO;\nmso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">- </span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;line-height:\n107%;font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-bidi-font-family:&quot;맑은 고딕&quot;;mso-ansi-language:EN-US;\nmso-fareast-language:KO;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA\">문의<span lang=\"EN-US\"> : </span>잇다\n홈페이지<span lang=\"EN-US\">(itdaa.net) '</span>문의하기<span lang=\"EN-US\">' </span>채널 이용<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; font-size: 10pt;\">(itdaa.channel.io)</span><font face=\"AppleSDGothic, apple sd gothic neo, noto sans korean, noto sans korean regular, noto sans cjk kr, noto sans cjk, nanum gothic, malgun gothic, dotum, arial, helvetica, MS Gothic, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></font></div></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p><p><br></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
